<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>AI Security Review - Feedback</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/main.css">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,"Apple Color Emoji","Segoe UI Emoji";
      background-color: #f6f8fa;
      color: #24292f;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1012px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d0d7de;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .timeline-item {
      display: flex;
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .timeline-item::before {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 16px;
      display: block;
      width: 2px;
      content: "";
      background-color: #d0d7de;
      z-index: -1;
    }
    .timeline-avatar {
      margin-right: 16px;
      background-color: #f6f8fa;
      padding-top: 5px;
    }
    .timeline-avatar img {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid #d0d7de;
      background-color: white;
    }
    .comment-box {
      border: 1px solid #d0d7de;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      flex-grow: 1;
      position: relative;
    }
    .comment-box::before {
      position: absolute;
      top: 11px;
      right: 100%;
      left: -8px;
      display: block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 16px;
      pointer-events: none;
      content: " ";
      clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 100% 0, 100% 100%);
      background-color: #d0d7de;
    }
    .comment-box::after {
      position: absolute;
      top: 12px;
      right: 100%;
      left: -7px;
      display: block;
      width: 7px;
      height: 14px;
      pointer-events: none;
      content: " ";
      clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 100% 0, 100% 100%);
      background-color: #f6f8fa;
    }
    .comment-header {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background-color: #f6f8fa;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d0d7de;
      border-top-left-radius: 6px;
      border-top-right-radius: 6px;
      color: #57606a;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .comment-header strong {
      color: #24292f;
    }
    .comment-body {
      padding: 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .comment-body pre {
      background-color: #f6f8fa;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px;
      overflow: auto;
    }
    .comment-body code {
      background-color: rgba(175,184,193,0.2);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
      font-family: ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,Liberation Mono,monospace;
      font-size: 85%;
    }
    .comment-body pre code {
      background-color: transparent;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 18px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 2em;
      background-color: #1f883d;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .empty-state {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px;
      color: #57606a;
      border: 1px dashed #d0d7de;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>AI Security Reviews</h1>
      <p style="color: #57606a;">Feedback from Gemini LLM during DevSecOps Pipeline runs.</p>
      <a href="/">Trang Chủ</a>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">
      <% if (reviews && reviews.length > 0) { %>
        <% reviews.forEach(function(review) { %>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-avatar">
              <!-- Avatar giả lập bot giống Github -->
              <img src="https://github.githubassets.com/images/modules/logos_page/GitHub-Mark.png" alt="bot">
            </div>
            <div class="comment-box">
              <div class="comment-header">
                <div>
                  <strong>github-actions<span style="color:#57606a; font-weight:normal;">[bot]</span></strong> 
                  commented on <%= review.date %>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <span class="badge">AI Review</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="comment-body markdown-body">
                <h3>Chiến lược Quét Tự Động</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>SAST:</strong> <%= review.sast_tool %></li>
                  <li><strong>SCA:</strong> <%= review.sca_tool %></li>
                  <li><strong>DAST:</strong> <%= review.dast_tool %></li>
                </ul>
                <hr>
                <%- review.html_content %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% }); %>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty-state">
          <h3>Chưa có phản hồi nào</h3>
          <p>Thuật toán tối ưu sẽ chạy qua Github Actions và tự động đẩy phản hồi bảo mật lên đây!</p>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>